            "review_title": "Review at Trippy Land",
            "review_text": "88UK\nColchester, United Kingdom225 contributions\n1\nExpensive but you get what you pay for\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe passed this place a few times as it was down the street from where we were staying. We decided to go in for an early drink on NYE, when we went in there were only two other drinkers, by the time we left it was nearly full. \n\nThe atmosphere was nice, well lit, very well stocked bar of high quality international spirits. The drinks menu was very interesting, standard drinks and a lot of unique signature cocktails. \n\nThe staff were fantastic, very enthusiastic about their craft and making sure you are well looked after. The drinks were really good.\n\nI’d recommend this place for a treat or if you are well off, worth mentioning that 15% service and tax is added to the bill so the cocktail prices were comparable to an average bar in England which for Vietnam is very expensive. You do get what you pay for here.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
